{"study_accession":"PRJNA733509","secondary_study_accession":"SRP321812","title":"Analysis of the transcriptome of CD34+38- cord blood cells treated with 3-deazaadenosine (3DA)","description":"Cord blood cells were cultured in the presence of 10 mM 3-deazaadenosine (3DA) or DMSO. After 9 days, the CD34+38- population was sorted using FACS and subjected to RNAseq. Our previous experiments have shown that treating other cell types with 3DA partially prevents senescence. By performing RNAseq, we show how treating cord blood cells with 3DA affects senescence, stemness and differentiation Overall design: 8 different samples. CD34+38- cells were obtained from cord blood cells (from 4 different donors: 338, 522, 535, 545) that have been treated for 9 days with DMSO (DMSO) or 10 mM 3-deazaadenosine (3DA).","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":8,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN19413721","study_accession":"PRJNA733509","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_from":"study","title":"cord 545 DMSO","description":"cord 545 DMSO","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5346146","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-07-21","attributes":[["source_name","CD34+CD38-"],["treatment","DMSO"],["days of culture","9"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR14679510","experiment_accession":"SRX11017863","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":33330075,"base_count":2733066150,"first_public":"2022-07-21","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM5346146: cord 545 DMSO Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN19413722","study_accession":"PRJNA733509","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_from":"study","title":"cord 535 3DA","description":"cord 535 3DA","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5346145","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-07-21","attributes":[["source_name","CD34+CD38-"],["treatment","3DA"],["days of culture","9"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR14679509","experiment_accessio